{"title":"Icebound Mate","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Icebound that attacks with slash (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>45</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>374</td><td>34.8</td><td>2,750</td><td class=\"muted\">1,122 · 48.7 · 8,250</td><td>10</td><td>in the wilds around 10, -946</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>8</td><td>in the wilds around -21, -964</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/icebound-mate?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>45</td><td>in the wilds around -120, -1068</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-mate\" data-map-level=\"55\">Show level 55 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 358 total, 35–88 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×35–88</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scrimshaw-tooth\" title=\"Scrimshaw Tooth - in 3 of 3 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/56365f769ba0492cc39b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scrimshaw Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-longsword\" title=\"Titanium Longsword - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c1a26b20d934bb883929.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Hollow Keel</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 6</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-412\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-648.3px,406.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:620.2px;top:-395.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:617.9px;top:-389.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:653.1px;top:-413.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:634.6px;top:-343.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:607.7px;top:-384.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:705.2px;top:-392.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:684.8px;top:-421.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:663.4px;top:-415.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:719.8px;top:-389.9px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -121, -1064 <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2, -952 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -51, -1088 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"icebound-mate\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Icebound: <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-deckhand\">Icebound Deckhand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-harpooner\">Icebound Harpooner</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/icebound-captain\">Drowned Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(58)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/de84d36608072047907d.svg\" alt=\"Icebound Mate\"></div><h3>Icebound Mate</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>55</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 55)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Icebound</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>374</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>34.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>4.5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>23 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}